# recall_flight's late claim of the glass: it reaches the host (line 13 passes) and the gate refuses
# it as revoked, so a check that no claim was refused must fail.
scenario mf_recall_claim
scene glass_door
seed 3
guests 1
settle 6s
net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2% reorder 10% reorder_delay 40ms
p1 grab rock_a as lift
at 1s p1 throw glass speed 7 as throw
p0 recall rock_a on p1 rock_a contact glass +2t as recall
expect result recall done
expect claims.count >= 1
expect moved glass <= 1cm
expect claims_rejected.count <= 0
